{
  "id": "NEH.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "NEH",
  "reference": "Nehemia 4",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NEH 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanibalati kayahuliire okwo twabaire nitwombeka eboma, yatamwa, yanigara muno, yareerura Abayahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agamba omu maisho g'abarumuna n'eihe lya Samaria ati, “Obuyahudi obu nibukoraki? Isi burayombeka ebintu bishubeho? Buratamba n'ebitambo bumare elyombeka kiro na mushana? Isi bwije bwihye amabare omu ntuumiro z'ejagata ehiire?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobia Omuamoni akaba amuli aha rubaju agamba ati, “Nikwo, eboma y'amabare eyo bulikwombeka, k'emboigora yakugikuba ekuumba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nshaba nti, “Waitu Mukama Ruhanga waitu, hulira nitujangurwa, ebijumi byabo nibakabilye, obanage omu mikono y'ababisha babanyage ebyabo babatware endore omu mahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entambara yabo otagiitiramu, kandi otabaganyira bufu bwabo; aha rw'okuba bakunigaize omu maisho g'abombeki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo twombeka eboma, yona eiganira aha nusu y'obwemi bwayo, enshonga abantu bakaba baina ekihika ky'eikora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai orwo Sanibalati na Tobia n'Abaarabu n'Abaamoni n'Abaashidodi bahuliire okwo okwombeka buhya eboma za Yerusalemu kwabaire nikugendelera n'okwo ahakambukire halikushubwamu, batamwa muno; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bema hamoi banama kutabalira Yerusalemu n'okugitabangura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichwe tushaba ahali Ruhanga waitu, tutaho abalinzi kubatanga ekiro n'omushana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abantu ba Yuda bagamba bati, “Abashutuzi b'elyombeka amani gabahwa, kandi hakyaliho ejagata nyingi, titulikushobora kugendelera kwombeka boma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababisha baitu bagamba bati, “Tibatumanye anga tibatubone, kuhika orwo turabajumbukiramu tukabaita, n'eikora tukalyemeleza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi ababaturaga haihi baija batugambira emirundi ikumi bati, “Nibaija kuruga buli rubaju babatabalire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo nteka abantu kuhonderana n'amahiga gabo, baina embanda n'amachumu n'amata aheru, enyuma y'eboma omu busoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndeeba, nyimuka, ngambira abakungu n'abakuru n'abandi nti, “Mutabatina. Mwijuke Omukama okwo aba muhango n'okwo aba w'ekitinwa. Murashanire barumuna banyu, batabani banyu na bahara banyu, abakazi banyu n'amaka ganyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababisha baitu kabahuliire okwo twakimanyire n'okwo Ruhanga atabangwire ebyo babaire nibenda kukora, ichwena twagaruka aha boma, buli muntu aha mulimogwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwema kir'ekyo n'okugendelera enusu y'abakozi bange egendelera n'elyombeka, enusu endijo ekwata amachumu, engabo, amata n'engabo z'ebyoma. Abebembezi bemelera enyuma y'eihiga lya Yuda lyona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibo babaire nibombeka eboma. Abaheleza b'elyombeka bakaba bashutwire emishutulire ey'omuntu kukoza omukono gumoi ogundi gukwete ekikwatokye ky'endashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi buli mwombeki akaba aina embandaye agikomire aha kiiga orwo yayombekaga. Omutezi w'enzamba akaba anyataine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngambira abakungu n'abatwazi n'abantu abandi nti, “Omulimo gungi kandi gurai, kandi naichwe twenaganagire aha boma, titugobangaine; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbali muraba muli kamurahulira enzamba yajuga, mube niyo mwirukira mutushangeyo. Ruhanga waitu araturashanira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo tukora omulimo n'amani. Enusu y'abakozi ekwata amachumu kwema omu bwire kutaishukana kuturuka aha nyanyinyi kuzoka aha iguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshuba ngambira embaga omu kanya ako nti, “Buli muntu n'omwiruwe bate nibarara Yerusalemu, batulinde omu kiro, bwamushana bakore.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo yaba inye anga barumuna bange anga abashaija bange anga abalinzi abamponderaga, taliho n'omoi yajwire myendo. Buli muntu yagyaga kutaha amaizi akwete ekikwato ky'endashana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
